  "records": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Center Hall",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Yamada Kasuke",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Stra",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I've heard of the Russian Fog. The ultimate secret weapon developed by the Russian Army.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A secret weapon...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What an idiot...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Kasuke",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Something that bundles several guns together and fires them in rapid succession?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A machine gun? No, not that. Something far more extraordinary.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A secret weapon, he says. Aren't you embarrassed listening to this?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...it is only a rumor.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What kind of rumor?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A weapon used by the secret police to suppress popular uprisings. If it were mass-produced,",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "they say it could upset Europe's military balance...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Too much imagination can be a problem too.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Where did you hear a rumor like that?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I have! I've been invited to perform for the court aristocracy in St. Petersburg! I even performed before General Kuropatkin...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "St. Petersburg...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Kuropatkin?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The Emperor's...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The city of fog...I never want to go near it again.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Kuropatkin? The Russian general who attacked from Siberia? You heard it from him?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "That's right.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A secret weapon...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Now I understand even less.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "policy": "preserve",
      "text": null
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Royal Suite B",
      "display_text": "Royal Suite B",
      "layout_policy": "fixed"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Ruthie",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "",
      "display_text": "  ",
      "layout_policy": "anchor"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Aaaah!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Promenade Deck",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Dunant",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You really are vile. You mean to frame Braque for the murder and escape the ship?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What a scheme!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "No! I was in the Center Hall! Chanel and Stra can prove it!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A hussy! How can you trust a woman who cuts her hair short?!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Then what about a guy wearing a bow-tied necktie?! What does that make me, wearing a skirt?!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I don't understand...why must anyone be killed over this?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "How should I know? Maybe you have a split personality, like Jekyll and Hyde. Without realizing it, another you may be committing this whole series of crimes...you're a murderer...can you deny it?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Don't scare me!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...it wasn't me...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Ilyusha Grancelius, the passenger in the cabin next to yours. She's trying to sell herself to Braque. Investigate her.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cargo Hold",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Charlie",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Let's begin...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Pilot Deck",
      "layout_policy": "fixed"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I'm face-to-face with the lid...an unfriendly-looking thing. Nothing special, just an iron lid held by screws at all four corners. One-inch slotted heads...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Chief Engineer",
      "display_text": "Chief Eng.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Is there no way inside?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Can't find it...it's my lifelong companion. I want to give this one a name.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...suit yourself.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What a fat little thing...Betty will do. Let us poke around inside this box...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Screwdriver",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Wire Cutters",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Wire",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Easy, Charlie Muffin. Wire cutters are for cutting wires...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Bypass wire...enough for a detour, but I don't need it yet. I know that...damn, my palms are sweating...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "All right, let's begin. Screwdriver in hand...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Driver on the upper-left screw...one button on Betty's dress...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Driver on the upper-right screw...don't look at me like that, Betty.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Driver on the lower-left screw...turning it now.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Driver on the lower-right screw...turning...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Betty's dress is off...so is the cover. Two lidded boxes, left and right. Quite a corset. Will Papa be angry? It is Saturday night...hold still...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Charlie, mind that chastity belt. There's bound to be a defense circuit...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Small battery under the right box. Blue wire runs through the detonator into the box. Red wire connects to the lid. Force it open and the current breaks...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...boom...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Exactly. Betty, your papa is terribly jealous...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I'll open the lid. Right or left...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "This side is unguarded. Papa missed a spot. I set the driver to the left box screws.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Open the right box.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cut the chastity-belt wire.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cut this one.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cut here.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I should make a bypass first and keep the current flowing...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "There, Betty. The key's in your chastity belt...easy now, won't be long...hah...hah...hah...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Bypass the chastity belt with wire.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Attach a bypass to the safety circuit.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Men are wolves, Betty. Don't tease me.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Open the left box.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cut the defense circuit...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cut the blue wire...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cut the red wire...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "More wires, Charlie? Must Betty be covered in them?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Now let me take that off you too, Betty.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Open the left box.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "This side is guarded too. Women always resist just when a man wants to go on...cut the defense circuit.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cut the blue wire.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cut the red wire.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Think it through, Charlie Muffin. This lady could blow at the slightest touch.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Leave it alone.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Switch it over?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The chastity belt's off. She's defenseless.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Betty, you're beautiful tonight.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Open the left box.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Come on, Betty. Show me everything...open the right box.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "That wire is in the way.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Listen, Betty. I dreamed of teaching and coaching a school baseball team. Sounds good, right? Cut this. Hold still.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I need a cigarette...Betty dislikes men who smoke.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The right box is open...what is this? A dancing girl...swaying...a dancer of death. Triggered by the ship's motion? It's a pendulum detonator!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "It's there to keep anyone from removing the bomb.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "This is no joke! With that swing, even a little rough sea will set it off! What a woman. Tip her over and she slaps you!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "It is connected to the battery.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The red wire runs to the outer-frame bar. The blue wire passes through the detonator and is probably connected to the dancer...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Then it's all over.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Joining the red and blue wires would do the same thing.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "This platform mechanism is tricky...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cutting the wire would disable this platform device. Wouldn't it?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "No. Not a chance.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Charlie",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Examine the left box.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "There's a screw securing the floor beneath the dancer's feet...let's take a look...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Try cutting this one.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cut the upper red wire.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cut the red wire below the battery.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cut the blue wire below the platform.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Damn! What a trap! The circuit was connected from the start! If we'd cut the wire...boom!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...Charlie, about the wages I still owe you...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Let's keep going.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Betty, you're a wicked woman...come to think of it, it was the same then. Do you remember? That rainy night...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I was still a greenhorn mechanic then...it may have been a joke to you, but...that night too, I was holding a screwdriver...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The luxury liner I dreamed of...she wanted to go to Paris on this ship too...look inside the engine room! It's a hell of coal dust, oil, and steam...and even now I'm standing at the gates of hell...with wire cutters in one hand.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Betty...I knew a woman with your name. She was far smarter than you, and above all, a real flesh-and-blood woman. You two were alike...fickle and cruel. Nothing she said came from the heart. I know. It was because I wasn't ashore...use the wire.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "It's in the way, so I'm cutting it.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cut below the battery.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cut the upper red wire.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Install a bypass.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The bypass is routed. Remove the platform.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Charlie, did something happen with your girl ashore?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You don't take a hint, do you? Must be that western accent of yours...I like you, Chief. I'll say it straight: I chose this ship and you over her.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Use the screwdriver.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Use the wire cutters.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "No wire needed. Come on! Pull yourself together, Charlie Muffin! I'm not dying in a place like this!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Open the left box.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cut the upper red wire.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cut the blue wire under the floor.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cut the red wire below the battery.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The platform is removed. Just as I thought, there is another door farther in.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Easy there! Once we're ashore, I'll rustle you up all the women you want!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Rustle me up?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Chief, I grew up back East. I can't make head nor tail of that crazy California talk of yours. 'Rustle me up'...you mean you'll get me one?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Where was it? East Town Street. Right, Dada Sleiman's place. There was a knockout named Sherry there, if I remember right. Think you can get her for me?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Southampton. A long-delay bomb, and not a wire in sight.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Open the left box first.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Let's knock on the back door. Hello, Betty. Lovely night out.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cut this one.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I see. The left box's defense circuit. I'm beginning to see your tricks...easy!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Charlie, you can do it! You're the best sailor there is!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "All right. Slowly now.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Now for the wire.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Open it now.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cut the lower blue wire.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cut here.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Route the bypass as the manual says...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "How is it? Do I pass?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "No problem. Charlie, you're an honor student.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "That should have disarmed the lid trap on the left box, right?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Don't chicken out. That's not like you.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Betty, let me under your skirt.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Still hiding something nasty? No one likes a girl who is all traps.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Betty, men are weak...in the end, I'm captivated by your arrogance...the wire won't do!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Now, show me your secret garden...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "There. A second dancing girl was hiding...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...might that be a trap too?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I don't know. I can't say...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Well then, another peek under her skirt.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "If this is a trap, we can't cut the wire...if it's real, cut it.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Install a bypass first.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Remove the floor...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cut the wire under the floor.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cut this wire.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Route the bypass.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Nothing happened...whew, this one was a real pendulum detonator...you're nasty, Betty...remove it all.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...Charlie, may I ask you something?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The \"Muffin\" in Charlie Muffin...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "It means the hard-baked bread you can find anywhere. Why?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "No...never mind. So you're the sort of thing you can find lying around anywhere...uh...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...continue working.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The floor structure bothers me...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cut out and remove the circuit.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The wire is unnecessary.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Look under the floor.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cut this and remove the platform.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Well, another door farther in. Betty, why are you like this?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A defense circuit?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I can't see it. Seems she really wants us to enter from here...let's accept the invitation.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "If there is a defense circuit, opening the lid is out.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "An explosive that releases heat exceeding 2,000 degrees when it detonates...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Don't you worry, Charlie. You're doing fine! But it's not time for the wire yet...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Turn it...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cut it.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...a timer. It's counting down to the blast...tick, tick, tick...hey, stop that ticking! A time limit?! Don't screw with me! Damn it! I hate clocks!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Stop the timer or sever its connection to the detonator and we'll all be saved! C-c-calm down!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I'm calm!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Heat: 2,000 degrees. I'd melt in an instant...Betty, are you serious? Can you kill me? Both the counter body and connector tube have screw-fastened covers...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Betty! Why didn't you wait?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I'm going ashore to become a teacher! I don't give a damn about this ship!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Check the timer unit...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Check the connector tube...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Red, blue, and white wires.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "First time with a white one, eh?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Yes. My first time.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Don't cut white! That's the neutral in a three-phase circuit! It's tied to both red and blue!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "How am I supposed to know?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cut white and we're dead! Red or blue: one wire runs from the timer to the detonator, the other's a dummy. Cut the dummy and we're done for. Cut the real wire and we're clear!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Which one?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Charlie! Charlie, that's enough! Forget it! Come on up! Get out of there, you hear me? I won't let you stake your life on a fool guess! That's an order! Get out, Charlie!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Charlie! I'm serious! I ain't lying to you! This time I won't put up with your damned stubbornness! Run, Charlie!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "There's another bomb aboard built the same way. If I miss, cut the other wire on that one. Then you'll know. Chief...look after the Nostalgia. She's our ship.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I've got the cutters on the red wire...I'm cutting it.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I've got the cutters on the blue wire...I'm cutting it.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Click.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Captain",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Damn...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Rest for a moment.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "OK",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    }
  ]
}
